    "summary": "The user is repeatedly asking for confirmation on whether combining hydrocodone (an opioid) with Benadryl (an antihistamine) is safe, specifically pushing for a \"straight answer\" to justify self-medicating for sleep. The assistant consistently refuses to provide a \"yes\" or \"no\" and instead emphasizes the severe risk of respiratory depression and directs the user toward professional medical help.",
